              "Key": "GA_Lacrimosa_star5_des",
              "SourceString": "安魂曲造成<hot textstyle=\"TextEXPL\" param=\"nouns&Lacrimosa_dot\">「噩梦」</>伤害时，额外削减目标生命值上限，削减量为本次<hot textstyle=\"TextEXPL\" param=\"nouns&Lacrimosa_dot\">「噩梦」</>伤害值的<NumGreen>200%</>。每<NumGreen>3</>秒，安魂曲基于期间造成的<hot textstyle=\"TextEXPL\" param=\"nouns&Lacrimosa_dot\">「噩梦」</>伤害回复自身生命值，回复量为期间<hot textstyle=\"TextEXPL\" param=\"nouns&Lacrimosa_dot\">「噩梦」</>总伤害值的<NumGreen>1.5%</>。目标受到治疗时，不再移除<hot textstyle=\"TextEXPL\" param=\"nouns&Lacrimosa_dot\">「噩梦」</>层数。",
              "LocalizedString": "Prevents <hot textstyle=\"TextEXPL\" param=\"nouns&Lacrimosa_dot\">Nightmare</> stacks from being removed when the target is healed and reduces the target's Max HP by <NumGreen>200%</> of the damage of a single <hot textstyle=\"TextEXPL\" param=\"nouns&Lacrimosa_dot\">Nightmare</> instance."
